	measure Daily_%_Change_in_FX_Rates_Against_GEL_Title = ```
			
			VAR MaxDate = CALCULATE(MAX(NBG_Rates[Date]))
			RETURN 
			"Daily % Change in FX Rates Against GEL - Base Date : " & FORMAT(MaxDate, "DD MMM YY")
			
			```
		displayFolder: For Graph Titles
